<h2>Target Media List - SMG launches RMX by Plan-Apps, the UK&#39;s first retail media exchange platform</h2>
<table border="1">
  <thead><tr style="background:#102B36;color:white;font-weight:bold;">
    <th>Rank</th><th>Publication</th><th>URL</th><th>Category</th><th>Category rank</th><th>Description</th><th>Readership</th><th>Audience reach</th><th>Reach verified</th><th>Beat journalists (name | title | email | confidence)</th><th>Authority /100</th><th>Authority note</th><th>Pitch angle</th>
  </tr></thead>
  <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>1</td>
        <td>The Grocer</td>
        <td>https://www.thegrocer.co.uk</td>
        <td>Grocery Retail</td>
        <td>1</td>
        <td>Weekly print and daily digital trade magazine covering the UK grocery, food and drink retail sector in depth, including supplier, retailer and technology news.</td>
        <td>Senior grocery retail buyers, category managers, brand marketing directors, and retail technology decision-makers across UK supermarkets and FMCG suppliers.</td>
        <td>Approximately 75,000 weekly readers (print and digital combined; figure sourced from publisher media pack, approximate)</td>
        <td>No</td>
        <td style="white-space:pre-line;vertical-align:top;">No current beat contact identified |  |  | [U] Unverified</td>
        <td>88</td>
        <td></td>
        <td>Offer The Grocer an embargoed briefing on RMX by Plan-Apps, positioning the story as a structural shift in how UK grocery retailers can monetise their media networks and attract agency demand at scale.</td>
      </tr>
    
      <tr>
        <td>2</td>
        <td>Retail Week</td>
        <td>https://www.retail-week.com</td>
        <td>Retail</td>
        <td>1</td>
        <td>Weekly print and daily digital trade title covering the full breadth of UK retail, including strategy, technology, ecommerce and store operations for senior retail professionals.</td>
        <td>C-suite and senior retail executives, heads of ecommerce, digital directors, and retail technology leaders across UK and international retail businesses.</td>
        <td>Approximately 17,000 print subscribers and 150,000 monthly digital unique users (approximate, sourced from publisher media kit claims; unverified independently)</td>
        <td>No</td>
        <td style="white-space:pre-line;vertical-align:top;">No current beat contact identified |  |  | [U] Unverified</td>
        <td>85</td>
        <td></td>
        <td>Pitch Retail Week an exclusive on RMX as the first UK retail media exchange, framing it around how the platform addresses the revenue challenge for smaller and mid-tier retail media networks.</td>
      </tr>
    
      <tr>
        <td>3</td>
        <td>The Drum</td>
        <td>https://www.thedrum.com</td>
        <td>Retail Media</td>
        <td>1</td>
        <td>Daily digital and monthly print marketing and media industry title covering advertising, technology, agency news and commerce media globally with a strong UK editorial base.</td>
        <td>Marketing directors, agency heads, media planners, adtech professionals, and brand strategists across the UK and international advertising industry.</td>
        <td>Approximately 1.5 million monthly unique users (approximate, based on publisher claims; unverified independently)</td>
        <td>No</td>
        <td style="white-space:pre-line;vertical-align:top;">No current beat contact identified |  |  | [U] Unverified</td>
        <td>82</td>
        <td></td>
        <td>Offer The Drum an embargoed release with a comment from Ollie Shayer on how RMX redefines the agency-to-retailer buying model and positions UK retail media for programmatic-era scale.</td>
      </tr>
    
      <tr>
        <td>4</td>
        <td>Campaign</td>
        <td>https://www.campaignlive.co.uk</td>
        <td>Retail Media</td>
        <td>2</td>
        <td>Weekly print and daily digital trade magazine covering advertising, media, marketing and agency business in the UK and internationally.</td>
        <td>Agency chief executives, heads of media, brand directors, and senior marketing professionals across the UK advertising and media industry.</td>
        <td>Approximately 100,000 monthly unique users and around 10,000 print subscribers (approximate, sourced from publisher media kit; unverified independently)</td>
        <td>No</td>
        <td style="white-space:pre-line;vertical-align:top;">No current beat contact identified |  |  | [U] Unverified</td>
        <td>80</td>
        <td></td>
        <td>Pitch Campaign an embargoed story focused on how RMX creates a new agency buying category between managed service and programmatic, with implications for agency media teams managing multi-retailer spend.</td>
