        <td style="white-space:pre-line;vertical-align:top;">No current beat contact identified |  |  | [U] Unverified</td>
        <td>79</td>
        <td></td>
        <td>Offer Marketing Week a comment-led story on how RMX addresses measurement fragmentation in retail media, angled at brand marketers frustrated by inconsistent cross-retailer reporting.</td>
