        <td style="white-space:pre-line;vertical-align:top;">No current beat contact identified |  |  | [U] Unverified</td>
        <td>75</td>
        <td></td>
        <td>Pitch WARC an effectiveness-angle story on how RMX&#39;s standardised taxonomy and cross-network measurement addresses the industry&#39;s longstanding retail media ROI definition problem.</td>
