        <td>10</td>
        <td>Retail Gazette</td>
        <td>https://www.retailgazette.co.uk</td>
        <td>Retail</td>
        <td>2</td>
        <td>Daily digital news site covering UK retail news, technology, ecommerce, and retail strategy across all retail sectors.</td>
        <td>Retail managers, buyers, heads of ecommerce, digital directors, and retail operations professionals across UK retail businesses.</td>
        <td>Approximately 300,000 monthly unique users (approximate, based on publisher claims; unverified independently)</td>
        <td>No</td>
        <td style="white-space:pre-line;vertical-align:top;">No current beat contact identified |  |  | [U] Unverified</td>
        <td>68</td>
        <td></td>
        <td>Send Retail Gazette a wire-ready release on the RMX launch with a clear news hook around it being the UK&#39;s first retail media exchange, supported by SMG&#39;s daily trading volume figures.</td>
      </tr>
    
      <tr>
        <td>11</td>
        <td>The Grocer&#39;s sister site: betterretailing.com</td>
        <td>https://www.betterretailing.com</td>
        <td>Grocery Retail</td>
        <td>3</td>
        <td>Digital trade publication targeting independent and convenience retailers in the UK, covering category management, supplier relationships, retail technology and in-store strategy.</td>
        <td>Independent convenience retailer owners, symbol group managers, field sales teams, and wholesale buyers operating in the UK convenience and impulse channel.</td>
        <td>Approximately 50,000 monthly unique users (approximate; unverified independently)</td>
        <td>No</td>
        <td style="white-space:pre-line;vertical-align:top;">No current beat contact identified |  |  | [U] Unverified</td>
        <td>58</td>
        <td>Score reflects strong sector alignment with grocery and convenience retail but a readership that skews toward independent operators rather than the media agencies and RMN decision-makers who are SMG&#39;s primary targets for this story.</td>
        <td>Pitch Better Retailing a story on how RMX opens retail media demand to smaller and mid-tier retail networks, giving convenience and symbol group operators a new revenue stream without requiring a full media network build-out.</td>
      </tr>
    
      <tr>
        <td>12</td>
        <td>Talking Retail</td>
        <td>https://www.talkingretail.com</td>
