        <td>Approximately 40,000 monthly unique users (approximate; unverified independently)</td>
        <td>No</td>
        <td style="white-space:pre-line;vertical-align:top;">No current beat contact identified |  |  | [U] Unverified</td>
        <td>65</td>
        <td></td>
        <td>Send Talking Retail a release focused on how RMX simplifies multi-retailer media buying for CPG brand teams, reducing operational overhead and consolidating campaign measurement across networks.</td>
